OL,3,CFormer Cambridge University professor
OL,4,CJason Arday found dead at home
OL,6,FFormer Cambridge University professor
OL,7,FJason Arday has been found dead at his
OL,8,Fhome in London.
OL,10,FThe Metropolitan Police said a 41-year-
OL,11,Fold had died after being found
OL,12,Funresponsive at an address in south
OL,13,FLondon on Friday.
OL,15,FHis death comes after he resigned from
OL,16,Fhis role as a professor at Cambridge
OL,17,Fon August 4 over a plagiarism row.
