OL,3,CFormer Cambridge University professor
OL,4,CJason Arday found dead at home
OL,6,FA London Ambulance Service
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "We were called at
OL,8,F3.06pm on Friday 14 August to reports
OL,9,Fof an incident on Daley Thompson Way,
OL,10,FSW8.
OL,12,F"We sent a number of resources to the
OL,13,Fscene, including an ambulance crew, an
OL,14,Fadvanced paramedic in a fast response
OL,15,Fcar and members of our Hazardous Area
OL,16,FResponse Team.
OL,18,F"Sadly, a person was pronounced dead
OL,19,Fat the scene."
