OL,3,CFormer Cambridge University professor
OL,4,CJason Arday found dead at home
OL,6,FThe university confirmed it would
OL,7,Fcarry out an investigation into the
OL,8,Fcircumstances surrounding the
OL,9,F"appointment and tenure" of Mr Arday
OL,10,Ffollowing his resignation.
OL,12,FITV News has approached the University
OL,13,Fof Cambridge for a statement.
OL,15,FThis is a breaking story, more to
OL,16,Ffollow
